AdminConfigVersionNumber.description:
Version of the key's current value: 0 = never written (value null, the default applies);
plus 1 on every change or rollback, never going back. The CAS value `expected_version`
of the writes.

AdminBlockedRequest.description:
A write request blocked with 44001 (04 §3.2 risk_hits with ref_type blocked_request;
BR-ID-36 细则「被拦截请求申诉」). Never the value that was hit, its HMAC or the rule's
conditions.

AdminExportAuditLogFilters.description:
Filters of an audit_logs export, the query parameters of GET /admin/v1/audit-logs without
paging, judged the same way (without audit.view_all actor_id is forced to the creator;
system rows match no actor_id filter).

AdminExportCreateTaxWithdrawalsRequest.description:
Quarterly tax export (BR-WDR-21, see POST /admin/v1/exports). unmasked true
asks for the full identity numbers (tax.export_full, totp step-up and reason required);
reason is only accepted together with unmasked true.

AdminPayAnomaly.description:
One pay anomaly (04 §3.2 pay_anomalies; BR-PAY-05 ④): money received for a CLOSED pay
order or for a merchant order number that names no pay order (then `pay_order_id` is null;
`out_trade_no` is null when the channel gave none). The evidence is kept server side and not returned.
